      "writtenOn": "2019-05-09T18:32:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Once you\u0027ve already established a common length, there is no need for stncmp().  memcmp() can be faster because it\u0027s not checking for NULL termination at every character.  Change to memcmp() before submitting.",
